  "prefLabel": "Plc 603.02 Advisory Board Officers",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 603.02 Advisory Board Officers. Annually, at the first meeting of the calendar year, the duly-appointed advisory board members shall elect, from among the advisory board members, a chair and a vice chair.\n\nSource. #14631, eff 9-21-26, EXPIRES: 9-21-36",
